        "n": "NTS Guide to: Dubstepforum",
        "s": "2026-11-04T20:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-04T21:00:00Z",
        "d": "A trip into the living history of dubstep with an hour-long selection of productions trawled from the long-running dubstepforum archive. Open from 2005 to 2015, the forum was the go-to online community for dubstep heads, where people shared event listings, production tips, discussed the culture and shared their own music. \nSelected and mixed by Compliments.",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/the-nts-guide-to/episodes/the-nts-guide-to-dubstepforum-4th-november-2026"
      },
